<h3><u>Utho hussain</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p><strong><u>Utho hussain</u></strong></p>

<p>Ye me hu me meri tanhayi. Ye tamashayi. Lo ayi gyaara muharram hai.</p>

<p>Kya khabar layi. Chali ye janibe zindan tumhari maa jayi.</p>

<p>Sawaar-e ham ne kiya tha tumhe mere bhayi.</p>

<p>1. (Ab awo ya mujhe kehdo na intizaare karo) x3</p>

<p>(Utho hussaine bahan ko zara sawaare karo) x2</p>

<p>2. Sawar hum ne kiya tha, tumhe dame rukhsat,</p>

<p>Lagaam thaam thi maine, bahaa late rikat,</p>

<p>kahaa gayi wo muhabat, kahaa gayi chahat,</p>

<p>(tamam apna mere sarpe, saaya baar karo) x2</p>

<p>(Utho hussaine bahan ko zara sawaare karo) x2</p>

<p>3. Watan se door hu kuch aur, door jaati hu,</p>

<p>Utho utho mere bhaya, tumhe jagaa ti hu,</p>

<p>Koyi bhi aata nahi mai, jise bulaa ti hu,</p>

<p>(Karaar jab mere mujko na, bekaraar karo) x2</p>

<p>(Utho hussaine bahan ko zara sawaare karo) x2</p>

<p>4. safar madine se kaisa tha, ye safar kya hai,</p>

<p>Na mehmile he na haudaj, na koi parda hai,</p>

<p>Ay sar mein khwab ye karbobala ka sehra hai,</p>

<p>(na jee sakungi tere baad, etebar karo) x2</p>

<p>(Utho hussaine bahan ko zara sawaare karo) x2</p>

<p>5. Dare furat pe ay sone, wali jaag zaraa,</p>

<p>Alam ke saye me rukhsat, bahan ko kar bhaya,</p>

<p>Suna hai sakht kathan hai, ye sham ka rasta,</p>

<p>(Sehen ye raasta abbas se, naamdaar karo) x2</p>

<p>(Utho hussaine bahan ko zara sawaare karo) x2</p>

<p>6. Mein awoongi mere bhaya, zuroor awoongi,</p>

<p>Kafan urhawungi markad, tera banawoongi,</p>

<p>Jahaa bhi jawoongi farshe, azaa bichaawoongi,</p>

<p>(mein kayd kaat ke lot awoo, intizar karo) x2</p>

<p>(Utho hussaine bahan ko zara sawaare karo) x2</p>
</p>